 begin="00:48.560" end="00:48.890">take </span><span begin="00:48.890" end="00:49.040">you </span><span begin="00:49.040" end="00:49.640">out </span><span begin="00:49.640" end="00:49.940">of </span><span begin="00:49.940" end="00:50.270">this </span><span begin="00:50.270" end="00:51.470">place</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.500" end="00:55.490"><span begin="00:51.500" end="00:52.460">Someone </span><span begin="00:52.460" end="00:53.150">you </span><span begin="00:53.150" end="00:53.570">could </span><span begin="00:53.570" end="00:54.590">lend </span><span begin="00:54.590" end="00:54.740">a </span><span begin="00:54.740" end="00:55.490">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.670" end="00:58.370"><span begin="00:55.670" end="00:55.880">In </span><span begin="00:55.880" end="00:56.900">return </span><span begin="00:56.900" end="00:57.350">for </span><span begin="00:57.350" end="00:58.370">grace</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.400" end="01:03.320"><span begin="00:58.400" end="00:58.580">It's </span><span begin="00:58.580" end="00:58.640">a </span><span begin="00:58.640" end="00:59.360">beautiful </span><span begin="00:59.360" end="01:03.320">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.350" end="01:05.510"><span begin="01:03.350" end="01:03.950">Sky </span><span begin="01:03.950" end="01:04.520">falls </span><span begin="01:04.520" end="01:04.640">you </span><span begin="01:04.640" end="01:05.150">feel </span><span begin="01:05.150" end="01:05.510">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.510" end="01:09.650"><span begin="01:05.510" end="01:05.660">It's </span><span begin="01:05.660" end="01:05.780">a </span><span begin="01:05.780" end="01:06.440">beautiful </span><span begin="01:06.440" end="01:09.650">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.680" end="01:12.590"><span begin="01:09.680" end="01:10.160">Don't </span><span begin="01:10.160" end="01:10.550">let </span><span begin="01:10.550" end="01:10.790">it </span><span begin="01